    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>Grading Policy:</div>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div>In-class Assessment: 50% (distributed at the instructor&rsquo;s discretion)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div>Midterm Oral&nbsp;Exam: 20% (Units 1 &amp; 2)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div>Final Written&nbsp;Exam: 20% (Units 1, 2, 5, and 6)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div>Mock TOEIC pretest: 10%&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "If you miss a class, it is your responsibility to obtain notes and information about assignments from classmates.\nBe on Time\nTry to not to use your phones unless it is really necessary\nDon't sleep in class, if you are tired or not feeling good, do let the teacher know about your condition",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
