    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Be a Good Student</div>\n\n<div>Don&#39;t use your smartphone when the teacher is teaching</div>\n\n<div>Bring your textbook. If possible, bring a notebook too.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Be Respectful.</div>\n\n<div>Don&#39;t Sleep in Class.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Come to class on time.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Be active in class.</div>\n\n<div>If you are really sleepy or tired, go out of the class, take few minutes rest and get back to class.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
